flowchart TD
  event{CI event}
  event -->|PR| pr[Light or labeled tiers]
  pr --> linux[Linux checks and deferral report]
  linux --> ready[Lead readiness]
  event -->|Next push| integration[Selected or full platform and Docker jobs]
  integration --> fanins[Integration fan-ins]
  fanins --> selected[Selected evidence only]
  event -->|Main or full dispatch| full[Full release-host suite]
  full --> exact{Exact source and full proof?}
  exact -->|Yes| jobs{Every required and observed job passed?}
  exact -->|No| reject[Release refused]
  jobs -->|Yes| proof[Release evidence accepted]
  jobs -->|No| reject
  linux -->|Failure or cancellation| failed[Checks fail]
  fanins -->|Failure or cancellation| failed
  class pr,linux,integration,full live
  class selected wait
  class ready,proof ok
  class reject,failed fail
